Package: Trex
Title: T Cell Receptor Sequence Embedding for Single-Cell Analysis
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Nick", family = "Borcherding", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ncborch@gmail.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0272-4232")),
    person(given = "Drew", family = "Voigt", role = c("aut"),
           email = "drewvoigt@gmail.com"))
Description: This package implements methods for embedding single-cell data
    based on T cell receptor (TCR) sequences. It provides standalone
    functionality to encode TCR sequence information via amino acid properties
    or sequence order through TensorFlow-based autoencoders. The package
    supports both geometric transformations using BLOSUM62 matrices and deep
    learning approaches with variational or classical autoencoders. Trex
    integrates seamlessly with SingleCellExperiment and Seurat objects for
    downstream analysis including weighted nearest neighbor approaches.
